        <mxCell id="note1" value="Note: Glue ENIs are private-IP-only by AWS design (per Glue docs), regardless of subnet public-IP/IGW settings. Every AWS service the job calls outside RDS itself requires its own VPC endpoint. This diagram reflects four interface endpoints + one gateway endpoint discovered necessary through direct troubleshooting, documented in glue_rds_connection_troubleshooting_writeup.md." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=11;fontColor=#666666;fontStyle=2" vertex="1" parent="1">
